# Copy to .env.local for local development, and set the same two
# variables as build variables on each Cloudflare Worker (Settings → Build → Variables).
# If the URL changes, also update connect-src in every apps/*/public/_headers (ADR 0010).
# Both values are PUBLIC by design: they ship to every browser.
# Security comes from Row Level Security in Postgres, not from hiding these.
